    "corrections": [
      "0401: invisible wind represented by motion of grass, ripples and fur; three different pictures and three final clips; glass and mouse hand meet.",
      "0402: exactly six seed bags with twelve boots; closed bathroom door; wash basin and towel when elf returns; final six bags sit on shaded lowest shelf.",
      "0403: whole cake, missing corner, dipped portion, dry bite, pieces and next whole cake remain distinct; chef pot placement corrected and retained during water experiment.",
      "0404: two cushions, hat removed before bag, both accessories on stool before wearing again; seated elephant has four short legs; mole hand now visibly meets final hat.",
      "0405: pig has short blue shirt and dark shorts; wand has no limbs; film, burst, detachable round bubble and floor wet mark are distinct; final cheeks soft and page seven hands on knees.",
      "0406: stone retains white cheek spot and limbs; golden petal returned to table; leaf mud bed and flower crown distinct; hands meet held stone; cart handle meets hoof and final drop lands on stone.",
      "0407: single moth with one pale line per wing; light dimmed then off; nectar proboscis reaches white flower; final unlit lantern enclosed in bag; low lamp kept inside canvas.",
      "0408: four tassels; two muddy prints revealed, completely hidden when folded; face remains outside shallow basin; folded blanket and prints raised to avoid bottom crop; shoes off beside clean blanket and final tassel touches foot."
    ],
    "limitations": "Simplified original geometric artwork. Full contact sheets and sixteen distinct full-size key pages actually viewed; does not assert full audio listening or publication."
